Remove profile and password manager UI (one profile, no password manager).

Saving passwords, auto sign-in and address/card autofill are already off by
default; this removes the UI around them:
- no profile submenu in the app menu (guest mode and "add profile" are off by
  pref defaults, the toolbar avatar button is hidden in toolbar_view.cc);
- no "Passwords and autofill" submenu in the app menu;
- no "Your saved info" (autofill, passwords, payments, passkeys) section in
  settings;
- chrome://password-manager is not served.
- no "You and Google" item in the settings menu (sign-in and sync do not
  work); settings open on Privacy; import stays reachable from the bookmarks
  menu.
